        "date": "2026-11-13T04:18:49Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/538-wire-skims (wire verify #1144, open runs #1109, wire UI #535: keep both sides)\n\nHand-resolved, both sides kept: WireContourOp carries main's clearance\nbeside this PR's skims (struct, is_sane, seed, DTO, re-exports, test\nliterals); generate_wire reads main's stock/clearance params and cuts\nthis PR's passes; motion's cut_pass takes main's laws::kerf signature\nand keeps the reverse note; wire_post.rs keeps main's open cut-off test\nbeside the skim tests. The skim gouge finding is fixed separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
